<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B><A NAME="v_005"></A>SECURITY OWNERSHIP OF CERTAIN BENEFICIAL OWNERS
AND MANAGEMENT</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The following table sets out, as of March&nbsp;30,
2023 the voting securities of the Company that are owned by executive officers and directors, and other persons holding more than 5%
of any class of the Company&rsquo;s voting securities or having the right to acquire those securities.</P>

