<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The undersigned (the &quot;<B>Stockholder</B>&quot;),
being the registered holder of shares of Class&nbsp;A Common Stock, par value $0.01 per share (the &quot;<B>Common Stock</B>&quot;) of
T Stamp Inc., a Delaware corporation (the &quot;<B>Company</B>&quot;), acting pursuant to Section&nbsp;228 of the Delaware General Corporation
Law and pursuant to the Bylaws of the Company, does hereby irrevocably consent to the adoption of the following resolutions with the
same force and effect as if adopted at a meeting of the stockholders of the Company duly called and held.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>

